id: standard-environment
name: Standard Environment
kind: battlefield
environment: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Solid ground under you and air around you. No effect - this is what every other
  Environment is a departure from.
text: >
  In most cases, combat will occur within a Standard Environment, but there are many
  cases in this galaxy- and universe-hopping setting in which Characters may have to
  fight in more strange or dangerous locales.

---

# What a character is standing on when nobody has said otherwise, and the one Environment
# that does nothing.
#
# A file rather than an empty string, for the same reason the Normal Light Level is a file:
# "no effect" is a rule with a name, and the picker showing it is the picker saying that
# somebody has thought about where this fight is happening. An empty option would read as
# a question nobody answered.
#
# No statements below the line, so the registry drops the program and this costs nothing to
# gather - exactly what the Normal Light Level does.
